# Wave W17-Z (Route 217): white pine — a bench snow pine in cool greens under a standard load: teal tiers with settled snow across the crown, slimmer than the bridge pine, on white turf (ground baked in). Route 217’s own tree — split from Route 216’s bridge pine by load entire (the bench carries less than the bridge) and from Lake Insight’s bank fir by stance: this pine stands alone on a bench, that one stands in a fir stand at a shore.
